  "new_feature": "Fuzzy-Pattern TM (FPTM): clause evaluation is fuzzy - a clause votes min(#literals, LF) minus the number of failed literals (clipped at 0) instead of all-or-nothing, so each clause represents many sub-patterns; also deterministic Type Ia feedback and a clause-size cap L. Drastically fewer clauses, less memory and faster training.",
